<h3 id="deflate-it">Deflate it<a class="h-anchor" href="#deflate-it" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<p>你可以選一些胖胖的目標讓他洩氣</p>
<div class="gallery-row cols-2">

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202410/pika-art-effects/images/pika-art-effects-14.webp" width="1232" height="928" alt="Deflate it（圖 14）" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
</figure>

<figure class="figure figure-video">
  <video class="gifv" muted loop playsinline controls preload="none" poster="https://deanlin.net/blog/202410/pika-art-effects/images/pika-art-effects-15.webp" width="960" height="713" aria-label="Deflate it（圖 15）" data-gifv>
    <source src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202410/pika-art-effects/images/pika-art-effects-15.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
